				<wikidot:authorName>ModernMajorGeneral</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>274283</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Yeah, agreed.</p> <p>To not have this post completely contentless: Clarke and Asimov at least provided the pleasant experience of reading a fun science fiction story before causing you to roll your eyes at the end, and also subverted the reader's expectations, which doesn't happen here given the joke tag.</p> <p>This is just the pun (a rather simple and dull one - at least in most shaggy dog stories they fully commit to creating a ridiculous, elaborate, contrived story with a ridiculous, contrived pun at the end) with a bunch of fluff text attached.</p> 
				 	]]>
